Please note that this repository contains example content that is distributed under different licences.
Assets with a metadata folder also record their owner and licence in the "legal" entry of its JSON files.

1. Content contributed under the 5G-MAG Public License (v1.0)
The licence text is in the LICENSE-5G-MAG-PL-1.0 file at the root of this repository.
- anchoring: all anchoring test scenes (owner: InterDigital), see anchoring/metadata
- geometry: all geometry test scenes (owner: InterDigital), see geometry/metadata
- gravity: the gravity test scene

2. Third-party content under Creative Commons licences
Attribution requirements are those of each licence; the credit lines are in the README file of each folder.
- awards: "Academy Award statuette", Virtual Museums of Małopolska
  (https://sketchfab.com/WirtualneMuzeaMalopolski), CC0 Public Domain
  (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/), see awards/license.txt and awards/README.md
- TV: model by RDW MIC, Małopolska's Virtual Museums project, CC0 Public Domain; Big Buck Bunny movie,
  Blender Foundation, CC BY 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/); added video texture and
  audio source, MotionSpell, CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), see TV/README.md
- video: living room scene by Carlos Miguel Vieira Maciel, CC BY 4.0; Big Buck Bunny movie, Blender
  Foundation, CC BY 3.0; added video texture and audio source, MotionSpell, CC BY 4.0, see video/README.md
- studio_apartment: "Studio apartment (vray baked textures included)" (https://skfb.ly/WwBD) by zamorev4d,
  CC BY 4.0, see studio_apartment/README.md
- furnitures: "mini sofa" by https://sketchfab.com/eyglohildur, CC BY 4.0, see furnitures/metadata

3. Content courtesy of third parties
- ar-video-plane: courtesy of CCMA
